The partner latent correlation was 0.354 in D1, 0.354 in D2, and 0.345 in D3. The estimates changed little across specifications, suggesting that the positive association was not driven solely by QI8 and QI9. Across conversations, partners who evaluated their interaction more positively tended to have partners who also evaluated it more positively.
